    <string name="tool_smooth">Smooth</string>
    <string name="tool_inflate">Inflate</string>
    <string name="tool_shape">Shape</string>
    <!--
      "Transform", not "Place", and deliberately not a promise of a gizmo.

      The rail entry names the CONTEXT the user is in — what the body's position
      and rotation are — which is the mental model Stage 020's direct handles
      will join rather than replace. Everything the entry actually opens today
      is exact numeric, and every surface it opens says so in its own title:
      "Exact Transform — Body #1". So the vocabulary is ready and no control
      claims a manipulation the product cannot yet perform.
    -->
    <string name="tool_transform">Transform</string>

